  <h1>Terms of use and copyright</h1>
  <p class="sommario">What the website offers, how accounts and purchases work and how the content is protected. Last updated: 30 October 2026. This is a translation; the Italian version prevails.</p>

  <h2>Owner of the website</h2>
  <p>The website ripetizionidianalisi.com is run by Carmine Tornincasa, who is also the author and owner of the rights to its content. Contact: <a href="mailto:carminetornincasa98@gmail.com">carminetornincasa98@gmail.com</a>, WhatsApp from the <a href="/en/contatti">Contact</a> page, Instagram <a href="https://instagram.com/ripetizioni_di_analisi_mate" rel="noopener">@ripetizioni_di_analisi_mate</a>.</p>

  <h2>The service</h2>
  <p>The website publishes study material in mathematics and physics: theory, worked exercises and exercises with solutions. Part of the content is free to read; full access to a subject is obtained with a one-time purchase, with no subscription and no renewals.</p>

  <h2>Account and access</h2>
  <p>A free account, created with an email address and a password, is needed to buy a subject. The account is <strong>personal</strong>: it may not be transferred, lent or shared, and the login details must be kept safe. An account can be used on at most two devices. In case of unusual use (for example logins from many devices or by different people) access may be suspended.</p>

  <h2>Purchases</h2>
  <p>Payments are handled by <a href="https://www.paddle.com" rel="noopener">Paddle</a>, which acts as authorised reseller (<em>merchant of record</em>): Paddle collects the payment, issues the receipt and applies the VAT due in the buyer's country. After payment the subject is unlocked in the account used for the purchase. The purchase gives the right to read the content of the subject for personal study; it does not transfer any right to the content itself.</p>


