  <h2>Infringements</h2>
  <p>In case of infringement of copyright or of these terms, the account may be deactivated without refund, and the owner may request the removal of the distributed content and take action to protect his rights as provided by law. Anyone who finds content from this website published elsewhere without permission can report it to the contacts above.</p>

  <h2>Pi, the assistant</h2>
  <p>Pi is an assistant based on artificial intelligence that answers study questions. Its answers may contain errors and should be checked; they do not replace the content of the website or the teacher's advice.</p>

